# REQUIREMENTS

The analysis uses the pre-built Docker image `manzh/llm4mde-r:1.0`.
R, the required packages, analysis scripts, bibliography, and input data are
included in the image. No host R installation, package installation, or image
build is required.

| Component | Requirement |
| --- | --- |
| Container runtime | Docker Desktop on Windows/macOS, or Docker Engine on Linux, installed and running. On Windows, use Linux containers. |
| Network | Internet access to Docker Hub for the initial image download. Analysis can run offline afterward. |
| Storage | At least 4 GB of free disk space is recommended for the downloaded image, its container, and generated results; a writable host directory for outputs. |
| Terminal | PowerShell, Git Bash, or a Linux/macOS shell. Interactive function calls require a terminal supporting interactive Docker sessions. |
| GPU | No GPU is required for this data-analysis workflow. |

Docker execution on macOS has been confirmed by the artifact maintainer.
Minimum CPU, memory, and disk requirements have not been benchmarked.

Use a PDF viewer to read figures and a text editor or LaTeX environment to
inspect or render the generated tables. These tools are optional for execution.
